@startuml CU-34
actor "Administrador" as Adm
boundary "«UI» Angular (Admin/Auditoría)" as UI
control "«Controller» API /reports/audit-log" as Ctrl
entity "«Model» AuditService / AuditLog" as Model
database "«DB» PostgreSQL (Neon)" as DB

Adm -> UI : 1: Accede a "Bitácora y Trazabilidad"
UI -> Ctrl : 2: GET /reports/audit-log?page=1&size=20
Ctrl -> Model : 3: get_audit_log(page, size)
Model -> DB : 4: SELECT AuditLog ORDER BY created_at DESC LIMIT ? OFFSET ?
Model --> Ctrl : 5: AuditLogPageResponse {items[], total, page, size, pages}
Ctrl --> UI : 6: AuditLogPageResponse
UI --> Adm : 7: Lista auditoría (usuario, acción, entidad, id, timestamp, diff)

Adm -> UI : 1: Filtra por usuario
UI -> Ctrl : 2: GET /reports/audit-log?user_id=5
Ctrl -> Model : 3: get_audit_log(page, size, user_id=5)
Model -> DB : 4: SELECT AuditLog WHERE user_id = ?
Model --> Ctrl : 5: AuditLogPageResponse filtrado
Ctrl --> UI : 6: AuditLogPageResponse
UI --> Adm : 7: Auditoría por usuario

Adm -> UI : 1: Filtra por acción
UI -> Ctrl : 2: GET /reports/audit-log?action=UPDATE
Ctrl -> Model : 3: get_audit_log(page, size, action='UPDATE')
Model -> DB : 4: SELECT AuditLog WHERE action = ?
Model --> Ctrl : 5: AuditLogPageResponse filtrado
Ctrl --> UI : 6: AuditLogPageResponse
UI --> Adm : 7: Auditoría por acción (CREATE/UPDATE/DELETE/LOGIN)

Adm -> UI : 1: Filtra por entidad
UI -> Ctrl : 2: GET /reports/audit-log?entity=Sale
Ctrl -> Model : 3: get_audit_log(page, size, entity='Sale')
Model -> DB : 4: SELECT AuditLog WHERE entity = ?
Model --> Ctrl : 5: AuditLogPageResponse filtrado
Ctrl --> UI : 6: AuditLogPageResponse
UI --> Adm : 7: Auditoría por entidad (Product, Sale, User, Inventory...)

Adm -> UI : 1: Filtra por fechas
UI -> Ctrl : 2: GET /reports/audit-log?start_date=...&end_date=...
Ctrl -> Model : 3: get_audit_log(page, size, start_date, end_date)
Model -> DB : 4: SELECT AuditLog WHERE created_at BETWEEN ? AND ?
Model --> Ctrl : 5: AuditLogPageResponse filtrado
Ctrl --> UI : 6: AuditLogPageResponse
UI --> Adm : 7: Auditoría en rango fechas

Adm -> UI : 1: Combina filtros
UI -> Ctrl : 2: GET /reports/audit-log?user_id=5&action=UPDATE&entity=Product&start_date=...&end_date=...
Ctrl -> Model : 3: get_audit_log(page, size, user_id, action, entity, start_date, end_date)
Model -> DB : 4: SELECT con múltiples WHERE
Model --> Ctrl : 5: AuditLogPageResponse filtrado
Ctrl --> UI : 6: AuditLogPageResponse
UI --> Adm : 7: Trazabilidad completa combinada

@enduml